+| g | (3,1) | `3|21|21` | h | (4,1) | `4|4|1111` |
+| i | (4,1) | `1111|4|4` | j | (4,1) | `4|211|31` |
+| k | (4,1) | `211|4|31` | l | (4,1) | `31|4|211` |
+| m | (4,1) | `31|211|4` | n | (4,1) | `31|31|22` |
+| o | (4,1) | `22|31|31` | p | (4,1) | `31|22|22` |
+| q | (4,1) | `22|22|31` | r | (2,2) | `4|4|22` |
+| s | (2,2) | `4|22|4` | t | (2,2) | `22|4|4` |
