+(p. 11).  For the limited purpose of reconstructing that analogy I also used
+the repository copy `refs/do.pdf`; its recomputed SHA-256 is
+`6ca30d797810400ddfcddb5b92b046796b3fdda5c1fb8f0ba378511506bbfed3`.
