+
+and hence, for (i\le m),
+
+\[
+x_i=-{1\over C}\left(d_i\prod_{q=i+1}^{n}d_q^2-\mu_i\right),\qquad
+x_0={1\over C}(\det\widetilde L_\infty-(Dd)^2).
