+
+**R-8, Lemma 2.12 (p. 7, (2.13)) — REPLAYED-SOUND.**  If the root is in
+neither (Q_1) nor (Q_2), all displayed subgraphs in the proof are
+positive.  For (i=1), the first edge formula has negative right-hand side
