+\[
+\det Q_1\Delta_1=-\det(\widetilde a\widetilde g_1)
+ +\det Q_2\det Q_3(\det\delta(\widetilde a\widetilde g_1))^2\ge0
+\]
+
+by (2.13) and (\det Q_2\ge1), a contradiction.  The (i=2) branch is
