+A. V. Domrina, “On four-sheeted polynomial mappings of \(\mathbb C^2\). II.
+The general case,” *Izvestiya: Mathematics* **64**:1 (2000), 1–33, DOI
+10.1070/IM2000v064n01ABEH000273, and states the advertised theorem (printed
